## 🚀 Featured Projects

### 🏨 Hotel Booking Platform

**ASP.NET Core · C# · PostgreSQL · React · FastAPI · AI**

> My graduation project — a production-ready, full-stack hotel booking system built from scratch.

**What's inside:**

- 🔗 **REST API** — ASP.NET Core with Dapper, covering hotels, rooms, bookings, reviews, services and file uploads
- 🗄️ **PostgreSQL** — relational schema with migrations, multi-hotel support and role-scoped queries  
- 🤖 **AI-powered pricing** — FastAPI microservice predicts dynamic room prices per date using ML (`lead_time`, `occupancy_rate`, `is_weekend`, `pickup_rate`)
- 📅 **Interactive calendar** — custom React booking calendar with real-time ML prices shown per cell, blocked dates and range validation
- 🛡️ **Role-based access** — three roles: `User`, `Admin`, `SuperAdmin` with route guards and header-based auth
- 🖼️ **Image management** — drag & drop gallery uploader, multipart upload endpoint, dynamic URL resolution across network devices
- 📊 **Admin dashboard** — full CRUD for hotels, rooms, bookings, clients, services with search, sort and filter
- 📈 **Benchmark script** — Python `benchmark.py` measures API and ML response times across all endpoints

> `React → ASP.NET Core → PostgreSQL ← FastAPI (ML)`

